WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.621
Ɓe mbi'i boo, to goɗɗo waɗii kalluɗum e liƴƴi ɗi'i, ɗum waɗata mo e saare maako.

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:12.105
Bana non, suka'en ɗon njanngina ngam ɓe mawnina ɓikkoy maɓɓe e yimɓe ɓe njooɗoto bee maɓɓe.

00:00:12.185 --> 00:00:15.526
Haa jooni boo, yahuɓe ɗon njaha dow laawol go'o.

00:00:15.606 --> 00:00:20.941
Ɗuum ɓeydaani ɓe, ngam to ɓe njogii ndiyam, ɓe teddinan yimɓe ɓe ardiiɓe en.
